@BankingAssistant_HostAddress = http://localhost:5079

### Health Check
GET {{BankingAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 1: Account Information (Should route to AccountAgent)
POST {{BankingAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What is my account balance?"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "context": {
    "overrides": {}
  },
  "attachments": [],
  "approach": "rrr"
}

###

### Test 2: Bill Payment (Should route to PaymentAgent)
POST {{BankingAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I need to pay my electricity bill for $150"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "context": {
    "overrides": {}
  },
  "attachments": [],
  "approach": "rrr"
}

###

### Test 3: Transaction History (Should route to TransactionsAgent)
POST {{BankingAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Show me my recent transactions"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "context": {
    "overrides": {}
  },
  "attachments": [],
  "approach": "rrr"
}

###

### Test 4: Multi-turn Conversation
POST {{BankingAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What accounts do I have?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You have the following accounts: Checking Account (Balance: $5,000), Savings Account (Balance: $10,000)"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Show me transactions for my checking account"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "context": {
    "overrides": {}
  },
  "attachments": [],
  "approach": "rrr"
}

###

### Test 5: Ambiguous Request (Should ask for clarification)
POST {{BankingAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Help me"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "context": {
    "overrides": {}
  },
  "attachments": [],
